<title>JAPAN: Nippon Seiki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Seiki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 35.96		vs	   35.66</p>
<p> Operating	    1.19		vs	  421    million</p>
<p> Current		1.60		vs	    1.32</p>
<p> Net		  909    million	  vs	  687    million</p>
<p> EPS		   26.53 yen	  vs	   20.07 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     34 million	  vs	  34 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 2.00 yen	  vs	    2.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Seiki Co Ltd is a specialised meter manufacturer, with a large market share in motorcycle meters.</p>
